1
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,880
Dear gods,

2
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,520
my rival and I

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,120
are joining the same production.

4
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,280
This is no small matter.

5
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,280
Please show me the way.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,400
Master,

7
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,040
what does this mean?

8
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,840
Over the next three months,

9
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,160
you and your rival

10
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,600
will unleash a bloody storm.

11
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:32,880
Tell me something I don't know.

12
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,320
Would you?

13
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,440
What did Master Purple say?

14
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:38,320
Here it is.

15
00:00:38,321 --> 00:00:39,439
I'll be as direct,

16
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,240
as candid,

17
00:00:40,241 --> 00:00:41,439
and as straightforward as possible.

18
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,440
Get to the point.

19
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,559
Your unequal relationship breeds pain and
tension.

20
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,919
Keep this up, and you'll both get hurt.

21
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,599
To break the deadlock, always be honest.

22
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,480
Don't try too hard.

23
00:00:51,481 --> 00:00:54,320
Do little things without expecting a
reward.

24
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,879
Little things?

25
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:56,880
That's it?

26
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,960
Can you really trust online
fortune-telling?

27
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:00,960
What did Master Red say?

28
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:09,520
Master Red said...

29
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,200
He said...

30
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:12,920
Master,

31
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:15,336
can it get worse than mutual destruction?

32
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:16,360
Just tell me.

33
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,720
I can take it.

34
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,320
Master Red said

35
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,600
you two

36
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,720
could get married.

37
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,800
"My Rival and Me"

38
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:03,100
(Episode 1)

39
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:09,960
Yiliang,

40
00:02:09,961 --> 00:02:11,480
on this production,

41
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:14,760
let's avoid any publicity involving Wei
Yanzi.

42
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,400
The fan club's biggest accounts

43
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:18,480
all say Wei Yanzi is devious.

44
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,880
Better safe than sorry.

45
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,720
We got here first.

46
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:26,920
Ignore him. Pull in.

47
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Stop.

48
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:32,840
Why did we stop?

49
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:41,880
You take it.

50
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,960
We'll find another spot.

51
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,360
Let's go, driver.

52
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,560
Wei Yanzi?

53
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,080
Since when is he so nice?

54
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,880
Don't assume the worst of people.

55
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,600
I don't get it.

56
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,000
One good deed a day.

57
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,480
Remember Master Purple's advice.

58
00:02:58,720 --> 00:02:59,800
Never forget it.

59
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,360
Beware of bloodshed.

60
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,480
You're a real saint.

61
00:03:03,481 --> 00:03:04,640
Of course.

62
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,240
Damn!

63
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,640
What happened?

64
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,760
We've got a flat.

65
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,720
I knew he did it on purpose.

66
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,960
The nearest parking is 500 meters away.

67
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,160
Filming comes first.

68
00:03:45,161 --> 00:03:46,600
We'll sort out parking later.

69
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,919
We've already cast Chu Feng.

70
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,440
And it's definitely not you.

71
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,800
Stop blocking the way. It's annoying.

72
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,400
Where's my bike?

73
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,000
He's pretty fast.

74
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,360
Screw you!

75
00:05:08,003 --> 00:05:09,936
["Add to block list"]

76
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,760
Our director will now offer incense.

77
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,480
Wei!

78
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,879
The spot you gave Mr. Gu gave him a flat.

79
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,880
What?

80
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,200
Are you sure?

81
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:28,960
Positive.

82
00:05:28,961 --> 00:05:30,440
That was Gu Yiliang's car?

83
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,600
I'm doomed.

84
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,280
It's only the first day,

85
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:37,520
and I've already offended my rival.

86
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,480
It's fine.

87
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,680
Gu Yiliang

88
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:44,120
won't think I did it on purpose.

89
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,680
I'm sure he'll forgive me.

90
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,320
A terrible omen.

91
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,520
Mr. Wei Yanzi, please offer incense.

92
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:10,960
It's all right.

93
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,640
It's all right.

94
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:22,320
It's fine.

95
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,880
No, no.

96
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,520
I need to apologize properly

97
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,840
to make this right.

98
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:31,799
Glad you're here. We're short on time.
Read the script?

99
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,720
I have.

100
00:06:32,721 --> 00:06:34,240
Good. I have faith in you.

101
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,680
I'll head to the set, then.

102
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,800
Mr. Gu Yiliang,

103
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:45,920
I'm sorry.

104
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,680
About the flat tire...

105
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,920
I'm sorry.

106
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,480
All right.

107
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,360
Get up first.

108
00:06:53,361 --> 00:06:54,400
I won't get up

109
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,360
until you forgive me.

110
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,480
I'm sorry. Sor...

111
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,160
What happened?

112
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,200
It's stuck! My hair's caught!

113
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,960
I'm sorry, Mr. Gu Yiliang.

114
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,080
I'm so sorry.

115
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,640
I'm sorry.

116
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,000
Hair and makeup!

117
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,680
If only certain people

118
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:10,120
acted this much on camera.

119
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,880
Some people's acting skills

120
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,999
all go into playing innocent.

121
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,640
Who do you mean?

122
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,320
You.

123
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:15,960
What do you mean?

124
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,960
Keep your idol in line.

125
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:38,040
We just started. Why all these scandals
already?

126
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,320
Wei,

127
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,240
stop searching.

128
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:41,736
Reading dirt about yourself all day

129
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:42,760
must be depressing.

130
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:48,200
Why not search your rival's name

131
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,720
and read the dirt on him?

132
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,160
It might cheer you up.

133
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:54,760
You have a point, kid.

134
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:59,760
Gu Yiliang.

135
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,240
Xiao Chen,

136
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,520
it's all praise!

137
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:15,200
Comparison really is the thief of joy.

138
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:19,760
What's this?

139
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,480
A matchmaking ad?

140
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,000
Xiao Chen,

141
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,280
I think I've discovered a wonderful

142
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,240
and deeply bizarre new world.

143
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,480
This rivalry is so intense

144
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,400
that the dirt on Gu Yiliang

145
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,240
has broken Wei's brain.

146
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,480
I haven't quite grasped its essence.

147
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,560
Let me take another look.

148
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,080
Xiao Chen, come on.

149
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:37,840
Time to work.

150
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,840
Come on, Chen.

151
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,360
Your phone.

152
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,200
Brother,

153
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,360
our duel today

154
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,920
isn't about winning or losing.

155
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,760
It's a friendly exchange.

156
00:09:58,760 --> 00:09:59,760
Cut!

157
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:02,480
Wei, where's your conviction?

158
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,759
You have to become this character.

159
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:05,760
You understand?

160
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,520
Sorry, Director Lu.

161
00:10:06,521 --> 00:10:07,961
I'll find that conviction right now.

162
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:12,800
Conviction...

163
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,119
Where are you, conviction?

164
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:14,600
Come find me!

165
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,280
Ready, Wei?

166
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,400
Thank you.

167
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,720
Ready, Director Lu. Let's do it.

168
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,280
Bamboo grove, shot one, take two.

169
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,240
Three, two, one.

170
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,360
Action!

171
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,400
Brother,

172
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,560
our duel today

173
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,200
is not to win or lose.

174
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,759
It's a friendly exchange of skills.

175
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,760
Cut!

176
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,000
Wei,

177
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:36,159
are you looking at an enemy

178
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,160
or your brother?

179
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,560
Brother,

180
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,400
our duel today...

181
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,600
- Isn't...
- Cut!

182
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:46,960
It's broad daylight.

183
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,280
Stop flirting with your brother.

184
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,200
Brother,

185
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:51,880
our duel today...

186
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,000
Cut!

187
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,560
And you definitely can't fall for him!

188
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,240
Come here.

189
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:56,840
Stop.

190
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:58,400
Everyone, take a break.

191
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,200
Wei Yanzi,

192
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,920
let me explain the scene again.

193
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:09,040
You need to understand this character.

194
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:12,120
Get into his background and relationships.

195
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:16,080
They debuted at the same company together.

196
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,680
How can one be in the heavens

197
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,600
and the other 20,000 leagues under the
sea?

198
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:22,280
Don't let the rumors affect you.

199
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,679
Your feelings for your brother

200
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,800
are conflicted.

201
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,720
You respect him,

202
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:27,199
but you want to defeat him.

203
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,960
Do you understand?

204
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,120
Yes, Director.

205
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,519
Good. Shall we try again?

206
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:32,520
Yes.

207
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,720
Everyone in position.

208
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,040
Let's go again.

209
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:39,560
Bamboo grove.

210
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:40,680
Shot one, take five.

211
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,320
Brother,

212
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,120
our duel today

213
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,720
isn't about winning or losing.

214
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,720
It's a friendly exchange of skills.

215
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,440
Whatever others may say,

216
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,600
it won't affect our bond as brothers.

217
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,600
Let's begin.

218
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:22,040
Hey, careful!

219
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:24,959
Mr. Gu, are you all right?

220
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:27,160
Are you okay?

221
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,760
Wei Yanzi pushed Her Majesty over!

222
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,719
Your Gu Yiliang fell down himself

223
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,600
and dragged our Yanzi down!

224
00:12:31,601 --> 00:12:33,080
Oh, please, girl!

225
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,280
Who dragged whom?

226
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,960
Everyone knows your idol

227
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,920
is an attention-seeking nobody!

228
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:37,680
Say that again!

229
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:38,600
Say it again on camera!

230
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,480
Didn't hear me the first time?

231
00:12:39,481 --> 00:12:40,840
Everyone knows your idol...

232
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,200
Girls! Girls!

233
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,200
Stop fighting!

234
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:45,120
May our boys live happily ever after!

235
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,680
What?

236
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:51,280
As friends! Friends forever!

237
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:52,280
Who are you?

238
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,080
Who do you think you are?

239
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,480
Listen,

240
00:12:53,481 --> 00:12:54,960
your idol's the fake innocent one!

241
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:01,480
Master Purple is frighteningly accurate.

242
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:04,520
All roads lead to the occult.

243
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:07,080
Gu Yiliang just joined the cast,

244
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:09,880
and sharing a frame with me brings him bad
luck.

245
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,800
Am I really his jinx?

246
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:21,880
One is a brilliant, aloof academic.

247
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,920
The other, a reckless rich playboy.

248
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,240
Their paths should never have crossed,

249
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:29,120
but the moment they met,

250
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:31,080
fate struck an unexpected chord.

251
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,320
What a melodramatic

252
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:39,200
yet beautiful love story!

253
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:42,920
Come in.

254
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:46,520
He came for you.

255
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,480
Mr. Gu!

256
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:57,280
Mr. Gu!

257
00:13:57,400 --> 00:13:58,560
Mr. Gu!

258
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:00,000
Hello, Mr. Gu.

259
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,320
Just call me Gu Yiliang.

260
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,160
Mr... Mr. Gu.

261
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:05,280
Sorry about earlier.

262
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:07,319
We have a lot of scenes together.

263
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,959
Let's rehearse when we're free.

264
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,960
Sure.

265
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:12,360
That's what I came to discuss.

266
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,520
If we rehearse more,

267
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,840
we'll develop better chemistry.

268
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,919
My rival caught me watching a ship video
of us.

269
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,880
Could this get any more awkward?

270
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:21,040
Have you eaten?

271
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:21,680
Not yet.

272
00:14:21,681 --> 00:14:22,801
Want something to eat, then?

273
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,960
Wei!

274
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,440
Here.

275
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,759
Wei, my ass!

276
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:29,079
Chen Youyuan, why come back now of all
times?

277
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:29,920
Get out of here!

278
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:30,280
Out!

279
00:14:30,281 --> 00:14:31,520
I wish I could leave too.

280
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:32,280
Mr. Gu.

281
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,679
Oh, hello.

282
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:34,680
Hello.

283
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:36,280
Filming starts soon.

284
00:14:36,281 --> 00:14:37,999
Want some milk tea to tide you over?

285
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:40,040
You hate sweet drinks. Please say no.

286
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,560
Sure.

287
00:14:50,040 --> 00:14:51,200
Only one cup?

288
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,200
Yeah.

289
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:54,360
How about...

290
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:55,520
You leave.

291
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,040
How about we share?

292
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:58,600
Got a spoon?

293
00:14:58,640 --> 00:14:59,200
I don't think so.

294
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:00,280
Yes, I do!

295
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:02,920
Here.

296
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,520
What would you like to add?

297
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:05,640
Your WeChat.

298
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,440
Oh, my stomach suddenly hurts.

299
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,480
I'll leave you to it.

300
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,520
I forgot to add you before.

301
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,200
Sorry.

302
00:15:18,201 --> 00:15:19,519
No worries.

303
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,400
Let me scan your code.

304
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,400
I'll scan yours.

305
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:21,760
Here.

306
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:22,080
That works.

307
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:23,280
Here.

308
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:31,360
That costume looks good on you.

309
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,880
Blue-gray really suits you.

310
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,119
Your costume looks great too.

311
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,280
Brick red suits me?

312
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,360
Is it that funny?

313
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:42,760
I never realized

314
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:43,840
you were so amusing.

315
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:46,200
You just lack an eye for beauty.

316
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,440
Chen Youyuan, I was wrong.

317
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:51,440
Come back!

318
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:58,840
Excuse me.

319
00:15:59,200 --> 00:15:59,760
Hello.

320
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:00,840
Have you seen Wei?

321
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:04,880
Miss?

322
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:06,240
Where did Wei go?

323
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,440
He left ages ago.

324
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:09,280
Left?

325
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,360
I'm still here.

326
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:11,400
Where could he go?

327
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,320
Miss,

328
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,560
I'm still here.

329
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:18,800
Where could he possibly go?

330
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:21,719
Miss! Miss!

331
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:22,280
He left in a hurry.

332
00:16:22,281 --> 00:16:23,399
He's off to a class.

333
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:23,920
No way.

334
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,280
He's not that keen on studying.

335
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,279
Only today did I learn

336
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:33,319
that while the internet dissects our
alleged backstabbing

337
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:36,239
and invents reasons for our supposed feud,

338
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:39,959
debating hatred that never existed,

339
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,959
there is a group of people

340
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,999
who firmly believe

341
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,839
that my rival and I share

342
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:51,080
a love never captured or confirmed.

343
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,440
You're late.

344
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,640
Come sit in the front row.

345
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:55,880
Yes, ma'am.

346
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,520
To our new students,

347
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:01,560
welcome!

348
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:04,000
I'm your professor of ship chemistry

349
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:06,360
and the moderator of the Niangzi fan
community.

350
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:07,680
Lovely to meet you all.

351
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:09,840
Today's lesson

352
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,720
is absolutely crucial.

353
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:12,936
What wasn't on last year's exam

354
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,296
will definitely be on this year's.

355
00:17:14,320 --> 00:17:16,040
Please take notes.

356
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,920
These people on the slide

357
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:19,760
are our Niangzi ship's

358
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,640
finest creators.

359
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:24,040
When our boys don't appear together,

360
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:27,200
these creators work purely out of love

361
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,720
to keep us fed.

362
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:31,680
The Found-Phone Forum AU.

363
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,640
A Hundred Ship Questions.

364
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:33,400
ABO and Hanahaki Disease.

365
00:17:33,401 --> 00:17:34,481
Fake Lovers, Growing Pains.

366
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,640
And The Room You Can't Leave Without Doing
XX.

367
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,320
All these stories

368
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:41,120
are about me and Gu Yiliang.

369
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,080
But Gu Yiliang and I

370
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:45,440
barely know each other!

371
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:48,040
Some new shippers

372
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,399
might think...

373
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,200
Gu Yiliang and Wei Yanzi

374
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:52,280
never interact on Weibo,

375
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:53,400
so there's nothing to ship.

376
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:54,680
Well, let me tell you,

377
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:56,280
you couldn't be more wrong!

378
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,200
Look here.

379
00:17:58,800 --> 00:17:59,720
Just watch.

380
00:17:59,721 --> 00:18:01,680
It'll leave you speechless.

381
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:03,360
This round, I'll go by.

382
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:04,600
Son of the Sea.

383
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,760
Why?

384
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:09,120
Because I was born in a coastal city.

385
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:10,520
That very night,

386
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,719
Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo,

387
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,680
clearly responding to our Wei Yanzi.

388
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:15,760
He said

389
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:18,240
his favorite fairy tale was

390
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,360
The Little Mermaid.

391
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,440
Keep watching.

392
00:18:24,506 --> 00:18:25,226
William,

393
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,080
how could you be so careless?

394
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:28,680
I remember that day.

395
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,560
I sprained my ankle on set.

396
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,776
The second I posted about it,

397
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:33,256
people accused me of buying trending
topics.

398
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:35,800
When Gu Yiliang's vlog came out that
night,

399
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:37,960
they said he was mocking his rival.

400
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:41,160
But now...

401
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:43,079
It's a subtle display of love!

402
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,120
Exactly!

403
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,520
Isn't it sweet?

404
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,879
So sweet!

405
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,439
Isn't he doting?

406
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:51,200
So doting!

407
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:53,800
Some people are alive,

408
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,440
yet are already dead.

409
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:56,960
Some people are dead,

410
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,360
yet live on.

411
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:00,560
Some people have never dated,

412
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:02,200
yet they've been together

413
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,280
for three years.

414
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:06,880
In the Niangzi fans' eyes,

415
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:08,240
Gu Yiliang and I

416
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:10,359
aren't hiding knives behind smiles

417
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:12,000
or silently provoking each other.

418
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:14,319
Our eyes are full of tenderness,

419
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:17,000
our love too deep for words.

420
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:20,720
This is more than shipping.

421
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:22,999
This is righteousness

422
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,160
and great love.

423
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:28,520
It's spreading goodness and beauty in the
world.

424
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:31,520
Oh, no!

425
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:33,200
My ship content!

426
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:43,040
Where are my earbuds?

427
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:45,320
I can't lose them!

428
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:47,880
They're essential shipping equipment!

429
00:19:48,280 --> 00:19:49,280
Wait.

430
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:52,920
Thank you.

431
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:53,320
Rival!

432
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:53,880
No, no.

433
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:55,040
Gu Yiliang.

434
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:56,440
Mr. Gu.

435
00:19:56,720 --> 00:19:57,720
What a coincidence.

436
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,240
Such a coincidence.

437
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:03,360
Three days of work,

438
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:04,920
and this is what you show me?

439
00:20:05,760 --> 00:20:06,760
I thought someone

440
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:09,440
had handed in their kid's school project.

441
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:12,880
Instead of making excuses,

442
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:14,000
think about

443
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:15,200
how to fix the problem.

444
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:18,560
Cheng Yan.

445
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:20,560
What a coincidence.

446
00:20:20,840 --> 00:20:21,880
Long time no see.

447
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:32,320
Good morning.

448
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:33,840
Slept well.

449
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,480
Have you eaten?

450
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:36,680
Quite full.

451
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:44,920
Why'd it stop?

452
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:47,640
It has been a long time.

453
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:49,480
These past few years,

454
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:52,240
I've hardly heard your name in the
industry.

455
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:54,040
I've changed my name.

456
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:55,440
It's Lucas now.

457
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:57,400
Never heard of him either.

458
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:00,320
Be my sugar daddy.

459
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:11,840
Zhu Mingming,

460
00:21:12,320 --> 00:21:13,440
did you come here today

461
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:15,920
just to make jokes?

462
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:23,440
I fought hard to land
the villain role in "Lan Jue."

463
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:25,960
But someone took it from me.

464
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:28,000
So I was hoping...

465
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:29,600
No.

466
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:39,720
Cheng Yan,

467
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:41,640
are you sure?

468
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:13,480
Stop pressing it.

469
00:22:14,280 --> 00:22:14,840
Keep that up,

470
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:17,040
and the elevator will think you're gaming
with it.

471
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:20,159
He said I'm gaming!

472
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:23,319
In fanfic, he'd say, "Don't
be scared. I'm here."

473
00:22:23,320 --> 00:22:24,599
If this keeps up,

474
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:27,120
I'm unshipping us!

475
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:30,480
Hello?

476
00:22:30,560 --> 00:22:32,000
Hello.

477
00:22:32,280 --> 00:22:33,160
We're trapped

478
00:22:33,161 --> 00:22:34,919
in the hotel's west elevator.

479
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:36,280
Which floor?

480
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:38,439
We're around...

481
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:39,000
The eighth floor.

482
00:22:39,001 --> 00:22:40,360
Around the eighth floor.

483
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:41,680
Please hold on.

484
00:22:41,681 --> 00:22:42,799
I'll send someone right away.

485
00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:44,120
Thank you.

486
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:27,680
Mr... Mr. Gu.

487
00:23:28,080 --> 00:23:29,840
What are you doing?

488
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:35,760
You.

489
00:23:46,360 --> 00:23:48,919
What the hell? This scene, this
atmosphere...

490
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:51,600
It's just like the fanfic I read last
night!

491
00:23:57,520 --> 00:23:58,559
Why are you blushing?

492
00:23:58,560 --> 00:23:59,040
Huh?

493
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:00,280
Am I?

494
00:24:00,480 --> 00:24:01,160
Well,

495
00:24:01,280 --> 00:24:02,680
it's stuffy and a little hot.

496
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:07,040
I thought you were thinking something
naughty.

497
00:24:07,080 --> 00:24:09,240
Gods above, someone save me!

498
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:10,320
What does he mean?

499
00:24:10,321 --> 00:24:11,399
Is that a hint?

500
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:12,560
No way.

501
00:24:13,360 --> 00:24:14,600
That look on your face

502
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:16,800
is just like my cat

503
00:24:17,280 --> 00:24:18,760
when I catch it stealing canned food.

504
00:24:21,280 --> 00:24:22,880
You have a cat, Mr. Gu?

505
00:24:23,560 --> 00:24:24,760
Just one.

506
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:25,840
It's adorable.

507
00:24:26,480 --> 00:24:27,920
Whenever it does something wrong,

508
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,840
it acts like nothing happened,

509
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,520
with its ears drooping.

510
00:24:38,080 --> 00:24:39,120
Does it eat well?

511
00:24:40,800 --> 00:24:41,800
Plenty of sleep.

512
00:24:59,040 --> 00:25:00,280
Sorry, Mr. Gu.

513
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:02,080
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

514
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:03,520
I lost my balance. Sorry.

515
00:25:09,920 --> 00:25:10,760
Help!

516
00:25:10,761 --> 00:25:11,919
I want to die.

517
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:12,999
But if I actually die now,

518
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:14,279
tomorrow's trending headline will be:

519
00:25:14,280 --> 00:25:16,039
Wei Yanzi and Gu Yiliang Die in Faulty
Elevator.

520
00:25:16,040 --> 00:25:18,080
Their Intimate Final Pose Sparks
Speculation.

521
00:25:18,840 --> 00:25:19,840
Come here.

522
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:23,360
It's not safe over there.

523
00:25:23,560 --> 00:25:24,800
If the elevator suddenly moves,

524
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:25,840
you could fall.

525
00:25:26,080 --> 00:25:26,800
Come stand with me.

526
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:29,120
No, thanks. I'm fine.

527
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:38,200
I'm safer here.

528
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:40,920
Sure you are.

529
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:56,080
Is he trembling?

530
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:03,599
Would you like some...

531
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:04,880
Wei!

532
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,160
Wei!

533
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,200
Bro!

534
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:12,160
Mints?

535
00:26:14,080 --> 00:26:15,080
Wei,

536
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,440
why is your face so red?

537
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:17,640
Wei!

538
00:26:17,760 --> 00:26:18,800
Don't call me that!

539
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:21,040
Thanks.

540
00:26:25,120 --> 00:26:25,680
Yiliang,

541
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:28,000
the director asked about tonight's burial
scene.

542
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:30,040
Are you sure you don't want a double?

543
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:32,240
I'm sure.

544
00:26:35,600 --> 00:26:36,600
Here.

545
00:26:38,280 --> 00:26:39,400
What's this?

546
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:41,160
Why are you giving me this?

547
00:26:41,280 --> 00:26:42,360
Wei Yanzi gave it to me.

548
00:26:42,560 --> 00:26:44,799
He insisted I give it to you

549
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:45,800
before the burial scene.

550
00:26:47,560 --> 00:26:48,800
What else did he say?

551
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,120
He said

552
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,360
it's for relieving stress.

553
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:52,479
When you're nervous

554
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,480
or scared,

555
00:26:53,640 --> 00:26:54,640
give it a squeeze.

556
00:27:00,320 --> 00:27:01,320
Yiliang,

557
00:27:02,520 --> 00:27:04,120
you don't think he's plotting something?

558
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:07,319
Would you like some...

559
00:27:07,320 --> 00:27:08,320
Mints?

560
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:15,840
No.

561
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,200
Where's Wei Yanzi?

562
00:27:18,040 --> 00:27:19,480
He brought it himself just now.

563
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:21,159
Then he said he had something urgent to do

564
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:22,160
and left.

565
00:27:23,320 --> 00:27:25,000
Something urgent?

566
00:27:32,120 --> 00:27:33,959
Wow!

567
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:35,839
Has the author been trapped in an
elevator?

568
00:27:35,840 --> 00:27:37,600
This is so realistic!

569
00:27:38,840 --> 00:27:40,720
So many new fanfics!

570
00:27:43,640 --> 00:27:44,720
Award-winning actor top,

571
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,320
pretty-boy bottom.

572
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,000
A masterpiece!

573
00:27:49,080 --> 00:27:50,080
Look at this!

574
00:27:59,120 --> 00:28:01,679
The bloodshed is behind us,

575
00:28:01,680 --> 00:28:04,959
and my relationship with Gu Yiliang keeps
improving.

576
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:06,199
I've figured it out.

577
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,999
People who ship couples

578
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:10,040
can't be too unlucky.

579
00:28:10,866 --> 00:28:14,000
Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo!

580
00:28:15,680 --> 00:28:17,999
A new gift today.

581
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:20,680
Just as "delicious" as the milk tea.

582
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,440
This is different.

583
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:25,560
This time, it's really different!

584
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:29,720
Even if I die

585
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:31,680
and get nailed inside a coffin,

586
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:32,920
from inside my grave,

587
00:28:32,921 --> 00:28:35,040
with these rotting vocal cords, I'll cry:

588
00:28:35,120 --> 00:28:36,399
Niangzi

589
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:39,760
is real!

590
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:45,333
Bonus Content 1: Son of the Sea

591
00:28:45,720 --> 00:28:46,879
Let's welcome

592
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,719
Mr. Wei Yanzi!

593
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,199
Hello, everyone!

594
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:51,560
It's been a while.

595
00:28:51,760 --> 00:28:52,240
Mr. Wei,

596
00:28:52,241 --> 00:28:53,759
in our last forest exploration round,

597
00:28:53,760 --> 00:28:55,400
your code name was Son of the Forest.

598
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:56,999
For this new adventure round,

599
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:58,800
what will your new code name be?

600
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:01,880
Well,

601
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:03,520
this round, I'll go by.

602
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:04,720
Son of the Sea.

603
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:05,880
Oh, why?

604
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:09,440
Because I was born in a coastal city.

605
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:11,720
I grew up eating seafood and breathing sea
air.

606
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:12,920
That's why I chose it.

607
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:13,920
Wonderful.

608
00:29:13,921 --> 00:29:15,559
Before we begin, as always,

609
00:29:15,560 --> 00:29:17,120
how about showing us a talent?

610
00:29:17,360 --> 00:29:18,000
Well...

611
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:19,480
Let me think.

612
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:21,120
How about this?

613
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:23,639
I recently learned a Russian tongue
twister.

614
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:24,919
Shall I give it a try?

615
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:25,920
Excellent.

616
00:29:25,921 --> 00:29:27,040
The stage is yours.

617
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:28,440
All right. Thank you.

618
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:30,119
Is this spot okay?

619
00:29:30,120 --> 00:29:30,560
Yes.

620
00:29:30,560 --> 00:29:31,240
All right.

621
00:29:31,560 --> 00:29:32,000
Okay.

622
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:33,440
Okay, I'm ready.

623
00:29:48,080 --> 00:29:49,199
Mr. Wei,

624
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:50,480
sorry, could we do that again?

625
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:51,920
We weren't recording.

626
00:29:52,240 --> 00:29:52,720
No problem.

627
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:53,920
One more time.

628
00:30:02,560 --> 00:30:03,640
Son of the Sea.

629
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:07,760
William, come here.

630
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:10,880
William,

631
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:12,760
how could you be so careless?
